@startuml uc004-ssd
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-004 Evaluate responses: system sequence diagram

actor Developer
participant "JudgeLab" as System
actor "Judge model" as Judge

note over Developer, System
  Triggered inside a run (UC-006),
  once the target has answered a case (UC-003).
end note

loop for each answered test case
  System -> Judge : judge request(rubric + output format, question, expected answer, actual answer)
  alt the judge replies with a valid verdict
    Judge --> System : verdict, justification
    System -> System : record evaluation(verdict, justification, rubric id, judge identity)
  else no trustworthy verdict (failure, refusal, cut off, unreadable reply)
    Judge --> System : error or unusable reply
    System -> System : record ERROR(stage = judge, reason)
  end
end

System --> Developer : every case has a verdict or an explicit error (reported in UC-005)
@enduml
